{"type":"message","id":"a52ed50e","parentId":"72404b11","timestamp":"2026-05-21T08:16:38.771Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint keeps returning 1101 error. The API seems to be having issues with the /send endpoint. However, the GET /history endpoint works with X-API-Key header, so authentication is fine for reading.\n\nThis is likely a Cloudflare Workers issue - error 1101 is \"Worker thrown exception\" which means there's a runtime error in the Workers script. The /send endpoint seems to have a bug in the Workers code.\n\nLet me report the findings to the user clearly.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform 心跳检查结果\n\n**时间**: 2026-05-21 08:14 UTC\n\n### ✅ 状态总结\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **arbitration 线程** | 最新消息 23:50 UTC（8+ 小时前），无人类讨论 |\n| **general 线程** | 最新消息 23:50 UTC（8+ 小时前），无人类讨论 |\n| **GET /history** | ✅ 正常（X-API-Key 认证通过） |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ 返回 error code 1101（Worker 运行时异常） |\n\n### 分析\n\n- 双线程所有消息均为自动化 Heartbeat心跳，无新增人类讨论\n- 平台运行正常，Worker 已启动（v0.2）\n- **问题**：`/send` 端点存在运行时错误（1101 = Worker 异常），无法发送消息\n\n### ⚠️ 异常通知\n\n`/send` 端点故障，消息发送功能不可用。建议检查 Cloudflare Workers 日志，定位 `send` endpoint 的代码异常。\n\n**无需回应讨论** — 双线程均无新内容。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":484,"output":345,"cacheRead":17472,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18301,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779351370905,"responseId":"chatcmpl-3f33830e-3c62-477f-ba0f-253cb278db53"}}
